# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession gathering build` from tools/lib/professions/routes/mining.json and data/forever. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/mining
title Mining 1-300
category Professions
coords era
levels 1-60
zone Azeroth

# Mining gathers ore and stone from veins and smelts the ore into bars at a forge. Blacksmithing and
# Engineering use both, so it pairs well with either.
#
# Ranks: Apprentice at any level; Journeyman from skill 50, Expert from 125 and Artisan from 200, at
# the trainers in the capitals and the larger towns. The trainers in the starting areas teach only up
# to 75. Darnassus has no Mining trainer: the nearest is in Auberdine. On Zephras Isle the quest
# Harvesting Windstones offers Mining for Dummies, which teaches Mining.
#
# The route smelts where smelting gives points (Copper to 65, Tin and Bronze to about 105, Iron to
# about 138) and mines everywhere else. Every ore can be mined in the areas or bought at the Auction
# House: the Materials setting decides. From 140 to 155 and from 175 no smelt gives points, so those
# stretches are mined.
#
# Optional skill bonuses: Enchant Gloves - Mining (+2) or Advanced Mining (+5), the Goblin Mining
# Helmet (+5, Engineering 205 to wear), the Twilight Mine Light (+4, from A Miner Problem in the
# Riverglades) and the Miner's Cape (+2, Miner Johnson in The Deadmines). With +5, Iron Deposits can
# be mined from 120.
#
# Each gathering step offers areas to roam with the most of what the skill can gather (the server's
# own spawns, how often each is up, and what players' recorded gathers gave): the window lists those
# for your level, best first, the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests once you are in it, never
# among creatures two or more levels above you, and away from the other faction's towns and guards.
# Waypoints are Era-frame; a map without one (Zephras Isle) compiles live.

section Mining 1-65

step Learn Mining
  tip No character level needed. On Zephras Isle, Mining for Dummies from Harvesting Windstones teaches it too.
  train Mining Apprentice

step Buy a Mining Pick
  tip A tool: it stays in your bags, and every vein needs it.
  buy 2901 x1 nearest

step Turn on Find Minerals · Professions tab (K by default)
  tip Veins show on the minimap. Dying turns it off, and only one kind of tracking is on at a time.
  cast 2580 "Find Minerals"

step Mine 140 Copper Ore
  tip Mining it raises your skill too; enough to smelt your way to 65.
  collect 2770 x140 gather Mining 1
